  "holidaySpecial.curpusChristiSaxony": "I-Corpus Christi yiholide lomphakathi emizameni esohlwini lweCorpus Christi Ordinance. Emizameni esele yaseSaxony, i-Corpus Christi ivikelwe njengeholide lezenkolo ngaphansi kweSigaba 3 (1) soMthetho Weholide waseSaxon.",
  "holidaySpecial.curpusChristiThuringia": "I-Corpus Christi iyiholide lomphakathi kumasipala achazwe ngokuhambisana no-§ 2 para. 2 kanye no-§ 10 para. 1 ThürFGtG, bheka i-Municipalities Key to Corpus Christi Day.... Kumasipala asele eThuringia, i-Corpus Christi ivikelwe njengeholide lenkolo yi-§ 3 para. 1 No. 2 yoMthetho Wezinsuku Zamaholide Nezikhumbuzo waseThuringia.",
  "holidaySpecial.defactoHoliday": "Iholide elingokomthetho ngokomkhuba: akusona isibopho esisemthethweni, kodwa iningi labasebenzi linikwe usuku lokuphumula.",
  "holidaySpecial.free_or_partitial_free_dependend_on_contract": "Ukungasebenzi noma ukusebenza kancane ngokuvumelana nesivumelwano esihlangene.",
  "holidaySpecial.goldCupParade": "Kugujwa njengeholide kuhulumeni wesifundazwe nabanye abaqashi esifundeni senhlokodolobha",
  "holidaySpecial.goodFridayGreece": "NgoLwesihlanu Oluhle ukusebenza kwezitolo akuvunyelwe ngaphambi kuka-12:00 emini nangemva kuka-19:00 ntambama. Imvamisa izitolo zivula ngo-12:00 emini bese zivalwa ngo-19:00 ntambama (zivule wonke ntambama kanye namahora amabili okuqala entambama)",
  "holidaySpecial.governmentEmployeesOnly": "Okuwukuphela kweholide labasebenzi bakahulumeni",
