  "holidaySpecial.israeli_free_or_partitial_free_dependend_on_contract": "Ngaphandle komsebenzi noma ukusebenza ngokwengxenye kwabantu bomphakathi wenkolo yama-Israyeli ngokuhambisana nesivumelwano esihlangene.",
  "holidaySpecial.mareidanOnly": "Kugujwa kuphela eMadeira.",
  "holidaySpecial.mostBusinessesHaveClosed": "Akulona iholide elisemthethweni kodwa amabhizinisi amaningi avaliwe.",
  "holidaySpecial.noHolidayButComonlyObsersvedGovermentFinancialBusinesses": "Akuyona iholide elisemthethweni, kodwa livame ukubonwa yizo zonke izigaba zikahulumeni, izikhungo zezimali kanye namanye amabhizinisi.",
  "holidaySpecial.northernTasmania": "Ibonakala kuzo zonke izingxenye zeTasmania ezisenyakatho ye-(kodwa zingafaki) i-Oatlands ne-Swansea.",
  "holidaySpecial.official_holiday_most_only_schools_and_authorities": "Iholide ngokomthetho wesifunda, ngokuvamile lithinta kuphela izikole, amahhovisi kanye neziphathimandla.",
