  "holidaySpecial.publicServiceWorkers": "Okusemthethweni kwabasebenzi benkonzo yomphakathi. Abaqashi abaningi banika abasebenzi babo izinsuku zokuphumula ezingase zingabi amaholide asemthethweni.",
  "holidaySpecial.regional": "Kuphela kwezinye izifunda.",
  "holidaySpecial.retailBusinessesMustBeClosed": "Akusilo iholide lomphakathi, kodwa amabhizinisi okuthengisa kufanele avalwe",
