  "holidaySpecial.sales_are_allowed_to_work_in_special_cases": "Uma usuku luwela ngosuku lokusebenza, abasebenzi bangase baqashwe ezitolo ngaphansi kwezimo ezikhethekile.",
  "holidaySpecial.schoolsAndSomePublicServices": "Izikole kanye nezinye izinsiza zomphakathi ziyavalwa ngalolo suku",
  "holidaySpecial.swiss1AG": "Iqashelwa ngokomthetho kuphela uma ingaweli ngoLwesibili noma ngoMgqibelo. Isizathu somlando salo mthetho ukuthi ukuze kuqinisekiswe izinsizakalo eziyisisekelo, akufanele neze kube nezinsuku ezintathu ezilandelanayo zokuphumula. Namuhla, lo mthetho awusalandelwa kangako, ngakho-ke njengomthetho, kuba khona ikhefu emsebenzini kunoma yimuphi unyaka.",
  "holidaySpecial.swiss2AG": "Nakuba kungewona usuku olusemthethweni lweholide lomphakathi, iningi elikhulu lezinkampani lisebenza kuze kube phakathi nosuku kuphela. Uma luwela ngoMsombuluko, umsebenzi umiswa usuku lonke cishe yonke indawo.",
  "holidaySpecial.swiss1NE_BT": "Kuphela lapho ngokomthetho uma kuwela ngoMsombuluko. Nokho, empeleni, uSuku lukaBerchtold luvame ukubonwa minyaka yonke.",
  "holidaySpecial.swiss1NE_ST": "Kusemthethweni kuphela uma kuwela ngoMsombuluko.",
  "holidaySpecial.swissa": "Iholide elilingana namaSonto noma elinye iholide elisemthethweni elaziwa kuphela komasipala abathile bekhanton. Nokho, eminye imicimbi egujwa kabanzi ingase ibangele imikhawulo noma imikhosi nakwezinye izingxenye zekhanton.",
  "holidaySpecial.swissB": "Usuku lokuphumula oluqashelwe ngokomthetho kuyo yonke i-canton",
  "holidaySpecial.swissC": "Iholide elinguhhafu eliqashelwa ngokomthetho (imvamisa kusukela ngo-12:00 ntambama) kuyo yonke ikhetoni",
  "holidaySpecial.swissc": "Ihholo lezinsuku ezihlanganisiwe elivunyelwe ngokomthetho (ngokuvamile liqala ngo-12:00 emini) kubasebenzi bakahulumeni kuphela, kodwa ngokuvamile liyagcinwa yizo zonke izinhlobo zabasebenzi",
  "holidaySpecial.swissD": "Ayaziwa ngumthetho, kodwa ngokuvamile igcinwa yibo bonke amaqembu omsebenzi kule ndawo.",
  "holidaySpecial.swissd": "Aziwa ngokomthetho, kodwa ngokuvamile kugujwa kwamanye amadolobha.",
  "holidaySpecial.whitMondayGreece": "Umkhosi woMoya oNgcwele uqokelwe ukuba yiholide esemthethweni kaHulumeni. Amabhizinisi azimele nezitolo ziyawugubha uma uqokwe njengeholide ngomthetho, ngesivumelwano esihlanganyelwe sabasebenzi, noma ngomkhuba nesiko lebhizinisi.",
